1
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:06,158
我觉得不太舒服
I don't feel so good.

2
00:00:06,158 --> 00:00:08,271
小可怜 怎么了
Aww, what's going on?

3
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:09,360
让我看看
Let's see.

4
00:00:10,249 --> 00:00:11,140
你有点发烧啊
You are kinda warm.

5
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:12,540
或许应该把毯子掀开散散热
Maybe get rid of some of these blankets?

6
00:00:14,852 --> 00:00:16,394
真可爱啊
Aw, that is cute.

7
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:18,260
你为了过万圣节打算吓我
You tried to scare me for Halloween.

8
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:21,420
这怎么可能没有吓到你呢
How in the world did that not frighten you?

9
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:23,200
其中有些还是我的真血呢
Some of this is my actual blood.

10
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,740
我在安装的时候把自己划伤了
I nicked myself putting it on!

11
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,000
亲爱的 你完全不知道要怎么吓人
Sweetie, you don't know the first thing about scaring people.

12
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:28,596
关键在于"可信度"
It's all about plausibility.

13
00:00:28,596 --> 00:00:30,260
你刚刚也太淡定了
And you were awfully casual

14
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:32,000
完全不像一个胸口被斧头砍中的人
for a guy who just got an ax in the chest.

15
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:33,580
如果你真的想吓我
You know, if you really wanted to scare me,

16
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,360
你应该等到我打开衣柜门时
you should've waited until I opened the closet

17
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:37,080
发现你用一条领带上吊死了
and found you hanging by a necktie.

18
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:38,560
什么烂主意
Excuse me!

19
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:40,380
我自杀吗
I killed myself?!

20
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:42,220
是啊 这很有可信度
Yeah. Totally plausible.

21
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,060
你傻乐了这么多年
I mean, you've been so happy all these years,

22
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:45,940
抑郁肯定会在某一天爆发 不是吗
the other shoe is bound to drop, right?

23
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:46,740
顺便说下
By the way,

24
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:49,440
我也不是很信用领带上吊这一套
I am not married to the whole necktie thing.

25
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:51,080
也可以是...
It could be, um...

26
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:53,211
举枪自尽或服毒自尽
shotgun or poison

27
00:00:53,211 --> 00:00:54,720
或者用电钻钻眼睛...
or a power drill to the eye --

28
00:00:54,720 --> 00:00:55,440
打住 打住
Stop. Stop!

29
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:56,880
现在你真的吓到我了
Now you're scaring me.

30
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:59,220
高手一出手 便知有没有
That's how you do it.

31
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,076
万圣节快乐啊
Hey, happy Halloween!

32
00:01:16,076 --> 00:01:18,040
本来是快乐的 却被你妈毁掉了
It was until your mother ruined it.

33
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:19,120
他只是在生气
Oh, he's just mad

34
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,580
他试图吓我却失败了
because he tried to scare me and he couldn't.

35
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:21,780
我很难被吓到的
I'm tough to scare.

36
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:22,980
我女朋友怀孕了
My girlfriend's pregnant.

37
00:01:23,260 --> 00:01:24,360
-不要 -菲尔
- No! - Phil.

38
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:25,436
她都跟我们差不多大了
She's our age.

39
00:01:25,436 --> 00:01:27,375
如果她都怀上孕了 会上新闻的
If she was pregnant, it'd be on the news.

40
00:01:27,375 --> 00:01:28,260
但这招不错
But good one.

41
00:01:28,260 --> 00:01:29,000
爸 对不起
Dad, I'm sorry.

42
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,820
我今早又没时间帮你把这个送过去
I don't have time to drop this off for you again.

43
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:32,640
艾达·梅·曼恩
Ida Mae Mann?

44
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:36,260
这不是那个整日坐在窗前的孤独妇人吗
Isn't that that lonely little lady that sits up in her window?

45
00:01:36,580 --> 00:01:39,200
他总是强迫我帮他送邻里协会的材料
He always makes me deliver his neighborhood association stuff

46
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,160
因为他害怕她
because he's afraid of her.

47
00:01:40,260 --> 00:01:41,040
这也太离谱了
That's crazy!

48
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:43,100
我经常去那个房子的啊
I go by that house all the time.

49
00:01:46,180 --> 00:01:47,120
这画面真不迷人 菲尔
Not hot, Phil.

50
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:51,140
好吧 她很瘆人
Fine! She's creepy!

51
00:01:51,620 --> 00:01:53,620
她像商店的招财猫一样整天坐在窗前
She sits in that window like a store cat.

52
00:01:53,620 --> 00:01:54,360
好吧
Okay.

53
00:01:54,620 --> 00:01:56,099
我会在跟比尔去吃晚餐时顺带送过去的
I'll drop it off on the way to dinner with Bill.

54
00:01:56,099 --> 00:01:57,604
他要带我去好食餐厅 预约的6点
He's taking me to Buon Cibo's at 6:00.

55
00:01:57,604 --> 00:02:00,560
我也要跟珍妮丝去好食餐厅 也是6点
I'm going to Buon Cibo's at 6:00 with Janice.

56
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:02,000
好恶心 我可不想看着你
Ew! I don't want to watch you

57
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,700
对她使用烂俗的泡妞手段
run your discount body-spray game on her.

58
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:04,800
把你的预约时间改到晚一点
Change your reservation to later.

59
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:05,680
臣弟做不到
I can't.

60
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,380
她必须在睡前4小时用餐
She has to eat four hours before bed

61
00:02:07,380 --> 00:02:08,440
否则就会出现胃反酸
because of the reflux.

62
00:02:08,640 --> 00:02:09,980
-你改时间吧 -不行
- You change. - No!

63
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:12,420
我们吃完要去看《德州电锯杀人狂 》
We're going out after to see "Texas Chainsaw Massacre,"

64
00:02:12,420 --> 00:02:13,920
我也不敢相信我竟然同意去看了
which I can't believe I agreed to.

65
00:02:14,140 --> 00:02:16,700
那听上去好有趣啊 我从没看过这电影
Ooh, that sounds like fun. I've never seen that movie.

66
00:02:16,820 --> 00:02:18,539
你敢信吗 我这个"克大胆"竟然没看过
Can you believe that? Me, of all people.

67
00:02:18,539 --> 00:02:20,200
那我们必须去看了
Uh, then we're going.

68
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,920
你觉得已经没有任何东西能吓到你了吗
You think you can't be scared anymore?

69
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:24,240
那是我看过的最吓人的电影了
That's the most terrifying movie I've ever seen.

70
00:02:24,780 --> 00:02:25,520
好极了 放马过来吧
Great, bring it.

71
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,080
我很期待被吓到
I look forward to being scared.

72
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:28,240
我竟然怀孕了
I'm pregnant?

73
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:29,520
菲尔
Phil!

74
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,098
你买到装扮服了吗
Did you get the costumes?

75
00:02:36,098 --> 00:02:37,980
是的 我时间不够
Yeah, I -- I didn't have a lot of time,

76
00:02:37,980 --> 00:02:39,860
于是我从上班的地方偷了些东西来
so I had to steal something from work.

77
00:02:40,220 --> 00:02:41,080
求你不要...
Please don't...

78
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,280
评判[法官袍]
judge.

79
00:02:42,780 --> 00:02:44,500
好吧 这个开头还算过得去
Okay, that's not a bad start.

80
00:02:44,580 --> 00:02:47,301
我觉得我可以用这个发挥一下
I think I can work with this, yes.

81
00:02:47,301 --> 00:02:48,915
莉莉 上别针
Lily, my pins!

82
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:51,320
万圣节让我们激动万分
We are so excited for Halloween.

83
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:52,565
多年来第一次
You know, for the first time in years,

84
00:02:52,565 --> 00:02:53,680
我们打算潇洒走一回
we're gonna get a little cray

85
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:56,040
去参加盛大的同志万圣节嘉年华
and go to the big gay Halloween carnival,

86
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:58,480
就像我们当初青春年少 膝下无子时那样
like we used to when we were young and childless --

87
00:02:58,560 --> 00:02:59,780
那年"潇洒走一回"这说法也还没过时
And people still said "Cray."

88
00:03:00,260 --> 00:03:02,860
以前我们总是把莉莉拴在身边
We -- We've always had Lily with us in the past,

89
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:05,660
但我们现在正在努力培养她的独立性
but we are on a crusade to make her more independent,

90
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:09,097
所以当有人邀请她参加一个派对时 我们就...
so when she got an invite to a party, we sort of, uh --

91
00:03:09,097 --> 00:03:11,007
-立刻替她回复会参加 -是的
- RSVP'd for her. - Yeah.

92
00:03:11,179 --> 00:03:12,220
但说实话 让她出去
But you know what? It's gonna be good for

93
00:03:12,220 --> 00:03:13,740
跟她同年纪的人社交一下对她有好处
her to socialize with people her age,

94
00:03:13,740 --> 00:03:16,775
而我们出去跟年纪只有我们一半的人社交也有好处
and good for us to socialize with people half our age.

95
00:03:16,775 --> 00:03:18,106
好啦
Okay.

96
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:19,120
米奇
Mitchell...

97
00:03:19,820 --> 00:03:21,680
朱迪法官[著名电视人物]
Judge... Judy.

98
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:23,076
你的才能
Your talent...

99
00:03:23,076 --> 00:03:24,960
你简直像被基佬天使亲吻过一样
It's like you were touched by a gay-ngel.

100
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,859
你之前还说我们再也不会穿
And you said we would never wear

101
00:03:26,859 --> 00:03:29,548
参加胡娇婚礼时穿过的伴郎鞋了呢
the groomsmen shoes from Pepper's wedding again.

102
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:33,020
稍等一下 小姑娘
Just a second, young lady.

103
00:03:33,020 --> 00:03:34,939
我们很高兴你今晚要去参加派对
W-We're very happy you're going to this party tonight,

104
00:03:34,939 --> 00:03:38,040
你不觉得这个装扮服 性暗示意味太明显吗
but, uh, isn't this costume a little, uh, suggestive?

105
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:40,340
这就是我在拉拉队的真队服
This is my actual cheerleading outfit.

106
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:42,569
你们知道我参加拉拉队了吧
You guys know I'm doing that, right?

107
00:03:42,569 --> 00:03:45,260
是啊 是啊 当然啦 肯定知道啦
Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah. Yeah. Totally.

108
00:03:45,260 --> 00:03:46,420
我们应该知道这事的 对吧
We should have known that, right?

109
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,580
乔 你提前回来了吗
Oh, Joe, you're home early?

110
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:51,800
我准备了一个惊喜...
I got a surprise for --

111
00:03:52,180 --> 00:03:52,940
曼尼
Oh. Manny.

112
00:03:53,647 --> 00:03:55,480
我知道你吃母乳吃到能走路的年纪
Look, I know you breastfed until you could stand,

113
00:03:55,480 --> 00:03:56,920
但你现在还玩不给糖就捣蛋 年纪大了点吧
but aren't you a little old to be trick-or-treating?

114
00:03:57,100 --> 00:03:58,080
这不是为万圣节准备的
This isn't for Halloween.

115
00:03:58,320 --> 00:04:00,440
我的单人秀正处于最后的排练阶段
I'm in final rehearsals for my one-man show

116
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,760
《西格蒙德·弗洛伊德:自我再出发》
"Sigmund Freud: Here Ego Again."

117
00:04:03,460 --> 00:04:05,140
我给你留了四张票 但如果你需要更多...
I've saved you four seats, but if you need more --

118
00:04:05,140 --> 00:04:05,820
不用 四张够了
No, four's good.

119
00:04:06,220 --> 00:04:07,080
话说 到底是什么惊喜
So, what's the surprise?

120
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,325
是给乔的啦
Well, it's kind of a Joe thing.

121
00:04:08,325 --> 00:04:10,318
他正跟他朋友一起在外面讨糖吃
You know, he's out trick-or-treating with his friends.

122
00:04:10,318 --> 00:04:12,386
我等他回来再给他看
I-I'll wait till he comes home to show it to him.

123
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:15,040
偏心地对待你的儿子们
Hmm, playing favorites with your sons,

124
00:04:15,740 --> 00:04:17,261
可能会无形中重复
perhaps unconsciously repeating the cycle

125
00:04:17,261 --> 00:04:18,380
你父亲造成的...
your own father perpetuated on --

126
00:04:18,380 --> 00:04:20,040
一张票就够了
You know, one ticket's gonna be good enough.

127
00:04:20,820 --> 00:04:23,140
屋里真的冷 还是因为我扮成
Is it cold in here, or is it just me

128
00:04:23,140 --> 00:04:25,740
《冰雪奇缘》里的冻人美女所以觉得冷
because I am the frozen lady from "Frozen"?

129
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:27,980
你为什么还不穿你的装扮服
Why aren't you wearing your costume?

130
00:04:28,060 --> 00:04:29,760
"随它吧" 歌洛莉亚 随它吧
Let it go, Gloria. Let it go.

131
00:04:30,100 --> 00:04:32,560
但是你说过既然乔跟德文一家出去了
But you said that since Joe was out with Devon's family

132
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:34,639
我们就要一起找点乐子
that we were going to do something fun together.

133
00:04:34,639 --> 00:04:37,040
对 找乐子 喝杯威士忌
Yes, fun. Have a Scotch,

134
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:39,360
给斯黛拉穿那件变异蜘蛛装扮服
put that mutant spider costume on Stella --

135
00:04:39,460 --> 00:04:42,580
好吧 我自己去找米奇跟小卡
Fine, I'll go meet Mitch and Cam by myself.

136
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:44,020
但等乔看到我给他的大惊喜时
But you're gonna miss Joe's reaction

137
00:04:44,020 --> 00:04:45,220
你就看不到他的反应了
when I give him my big surprise!

138
00:04:45,300 --> 00:04:46,920
一个糖果棒而已啊
It's just a candy bar!

139
00:04:47,900 --> 00:04:50,780
一年半前 在一个未曝光事件中
18 months ago, in an underreported news event,

140
00:04:50,904 --> 00:04:53,120
娜迦零食食品公司
NagaSnacki Food Solutions

141
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:56,380
停产了有史以来最棒的糖果棒
discontinued the greatest candy bar of all time.

142
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,480
老软糖
The Fudgy Duddy.

143
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,820
经过艰难的搜索
After an exhaustive search --

144
00:04:59,940 --> 00:05:00,900
就谷歌了一下
One Googling.

145
00:05:01,460 --> 00:05:03,340
我找到了这个尤物
...I tracked down this beauty.

146
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:07,720
现在我儿子可以体验到我们从小吃到大的
Now my son can experience the kind of quality confection

147
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:09,860
高品质糖果了
our generation grew up with.

148
00:05:10,180 --> 00:05:10,440
什么我们
"Our"?

149
00:05:10,980 --> 00:05:13,440
我是X一代的 可不是你们婴儿潮时代的
I am a Gen X. Don't make me a Boomer.

150
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:16,900
上周发生了一件很可怕的事情
Something horrible happened to me last weekend.

151
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:19,320
我要...
I'll just have the...

152
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:20,520
海鲜沙拉
seafood salad.

153
00:05:20,780 --> 00:05:22,100
好的 您的丈夫呢
Very good. And for your husband?

154
00:05:22,631 --> 00:05:24,920
不不 他是我丈夫
Oh, no, no. He's my husband.

155
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:25,720
他说的就是丈夫
That's what he said.

156
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:29,220
我一直害怕的一天终于来了
The day I have dreaded finally came --

157
00:05:29,700 --> 00:05:33,180
人们开始直接判断我是杰的...
people assume that I am Jay's...

158
00:05:33,180 --> 00:05:33,880
老婆
wife.

159
00:05:34,700 --> 00:05:35,880
孩子们玩得开心
You kids have fun!

160
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:37,420
曼尼 你在干什么
Manny. What are you doing?

161
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:39,360
防止你的房子被扔鸡蛋啊
Saving your house from being egged.

162
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:40,380
你的糖果都送完了
You're all out of treats.

163
00:05:40,660 --> 00:05:42,260
还好我找到了一个糖果棒送出去
Luckily I found a candy bar to give away.

164
00:05:42,260 --> 00:05:43,200
糟糕
Oh, no.

165
00:05:43,620 --> 00:05:44,600
我的老软糖没了
My Fudgy Duddy's gone!

166
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:46,480
不许动
Nobody move!

167
00:05:46,931 --> 00:05:52,620
你好 两张《德州电锯杀人狂》的票
Hello there. Uh, two for "Texas Chainsaw Massacre."

168
00:05:52,620 --> 00:05:54,680
抱歉 几周前就卖完了
Sorry, that sold out weeks ago.

169
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:57,950
要在我们的网站上更新啊 伯纳德
Which should've been updated on our website, Bernard!

170
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,480
不过有一部超吓人的
But we still have seats

171
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:02,408
日本电影还有票
for that super scary Japanese film.

172
00:06:02,408 --> 00:06:04,300
-可以 -稍等
- Yes! - Uh, pause.

173
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:06,160
有多吓人 有多日本
How scary? How Japanese?

174
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:10,920
返老婴儿杀人案
"Make Dead with Old-Face Baby."

175
00:06:11,155 --> 00:06:12,500
-请给我们两张票 -不
- Two, please. - No, um...

176
00:06:12,500 --> 00:06:14,834
