You're sure you gave this to a Spider-Man?

247
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:47,700
我确定
I'm sure.

248
00:08:48,180 --> 00:08:49,541
而且很难不注意到
You know, it's also hard to ignore

249
00:08:49,541 --> 00:08:51,580
你找的这个物品形状像阴茎
that this object you seek has a phallic shape --

250
00:08:51,580 --> 00:08:53,569
我当年为毛劝你放弃念哑剧专业
Why did I talk you out of that mime major?

251
00:08:53,569 --> 00:08:54,963
