I think I have some idea.

284
00:09:58,740 --> 00:10:00,940
比尔离开了几周 去扑灭山火
Bill's been away fighting a forest fire for weeks.

285
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,940
他打了一次电话给我 说他想念我
He called me once to say he missed me,

286
00:10:02,940 --> 00:10:05,020
于是我给他发了一张我穿着可爱衣服的照片
so I sent him a pic of me in a cute outfit.

287
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:08,080
