我准备好过这种生活了
I'm ready for this now.

323
00:11:15,260 --> 00:11:17,280
你心智真成熟
You are such a mature person.

324
00:11:17,380 --> 00:11:19,980
我都无法想象你狂野贪玩的样子
I can't even imagine you as a wild child.

325
00:11:20,140 --> 00:11:21,060
是啊
Oh, yeah.

326
00:11:21,140 --> 00:11:22,700
五年前 我们袭击了一栋房子
Five years ago, we hit this one house.

327
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,720
那家人每次都报警抓我们
The family was always calling the cops on us

328
