生活有它独特的幽默感
Life's funny.

350
00:12:15,500 --> 00:12:15,840
是啊
Yeah.

351
00:12:16,290 --> 00:12:17,920
第二天
Yeah, the next day,

352
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:19,740
我本来要去婚姻咨询处和他会合
I was supposed to meet him at couples therapy.

353
00:12:20,348 --> 00:12:22,900
但我没赶上 因为我的车坏了
But I didn't make it 'cause my car died.

354
00:12:22,900 --> 00:12:23,920
油箱里有糖
Sugar in the tank.

355
00:12:24,280 --> 00:12:26,238
所以我错过了那次咨询
So I missed the appointment.

356
00:12:26,238 --> 00:12:28,020
他去买咖啡
He went for a coffee,

357
00:12:28,020 --> 00:12:30,100
爱上了咖啡师
fell in love with the barista,

358
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:32,900
现在我住在公寓楼
and now I am living in a condo,

359
00:12:32,900 --> 00:12:34,400
和小屁孩约会
dating a friggin' child!

360
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:35,380
珍妮丝
Janice.

361
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,800
现在提这个或许不是时候 不过
This may be a bad time to mention it, but...

362
00:12:38,380 --> 00:12:40,220
我的钱不够付泊车费
I don't have enough money for the valet.

363
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:51,199
莉莉还是不接电话 你追踪她的定位了吗
Lily is still not answering. Did you track her location?

364
00:12:51,199 --> 00:12:53,323
是的 上面说她回家了
Uh, yeah. It says that she's at our house?

365
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:54,940
你觉得她把那男孩带回家了吗
Do you think she took that boy home?

366
00:12:55,060 --> 00:12:56,420
当然带回家了
Of course she did!

367
00:12:56,820 --> 00:12:59,520
家里没人 那么多安妮塔·贝克的唱片
An empty house, all those Anita Baker records.

368
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:01,380
那是镇上最性感的地方
It's the sexiest place in town.

369
00:13:01,380 --> 00:13:02,380
我们必须回家
We have to get home!

370
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:04,400
想从这人潮中挤出去得花上一小时
Okay, it's gonna take us an hour just to get out of here.

371
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:06,140
不 我们只要从这个迷宫走
No, no, we can save ourselves 20 minutes

372
00:13:06,140 --> 00:13:07,297
就能省二十分钟
just by cutting through this maze.

373
00:13:07,297 --> 00:13:09,640
不 我讨厌这些玩意
No! No. I-I hate those things.

374
00:13:09,640 --> 00:13:11,320
米奇尔 我们基本算是逼自己女儿
Mitchell, we basically forced our daughter

375
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:13,360
对发情的青少年投怀送抱
into the arms of a hormonal teen.

376
00:13:13,360 --> 00:13:14,260
说实话
And let's be honest,

377
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:16,860
我们到底是想让她更独立一些
was it because we wanted more independence for her

378
00:13:16,860 --> 00:13:18,080
还是自己
or for us?

379
00:13:22,300 --> 00:13:23,020
那好
All right.

380
00:13:23,420 --> 00:13:24,879
拿出点气魄来
Now, try to have some backbone.

381
00:13:24,879 --> 00:13:28,448
我就在这 知道吗
I'm-I'm-I'm right here. Okay?

382
00:13:28,640 --> 00:13:31,100
记住 这都是为了我们女儿
And just remember, this is for our daughter.

383
00:13:34,553 --> 00:13:35,586
小卡
Ohh, Cam...

384
00:13:37,617 --> 00:13:39,168
我知道这让我听起来很肤浅
I know it makes me seem shallow,

385
00:13:39,168 --> 00:13:41,921
但他的身材赞爆了
but he had such a crazy body!

386
00:13:41,921 --> 00:13:44,123
我怎么再去面对那些宅男的身材
How am I supposed to go back to nerd butts?

387
00:13:44,143 --> 00:13:47,356
无论我需要什么 她包里都有
No matter what I'd need, it'd be right there in her purse --

388
00:13:47,627 --> 00:13:51,140
创可贴 湿巾 葡萄干
Band-Aids, wet wipes, raisins.

389
00:13:51,140 --> 00:13:52,892
因为有时我不是真的生气
Because sometimes I'm not angry.

390
00:13:52,892 --> 00:13:54,234
只是饿了
I'm just hungry.

391
00:13:54,313 --> 00:13:56,135
你知道她包里没有什么吗
You know what she's not gonna find in that purse?

392
00:13:56,486 --> 00:13:57,837
比你更好的人
Someone better than you.

393
00:13:57,837 --> 00:13:59,008
-真的吗 -真的
- Really? - Yeah.

394
00:13:59,008 --> 00:14:00,670
你能找到比她更好的
You can do better than --

395
00:14:00,860 --> 00:14:02,960
我一时想不起她名字 反正是茉莉的老妈
I'm forgetting her name right now, so Molly's mom.

396
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:05,820
要知道 我不是因为你安慰我才安慰你
You know, I'm not just saying it because you said it,

397
00:14:05,820 --> 00:14:08,540
但我一直都觉得比尔配不上你
but I never thought Bill was good enough for you.

398
00:14:08,540 --> 00:14:09,080
真的吗
Seriously?

399
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:11,200
你值得拥有聪明又有求知欲的人
You deserve someone smart and curious.

400
00:14:11,980 --> 00:14:14,200
说实话 他每次出门时都说
Be honest, didn't you get sick of him saying

401
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:17,380
"我赌我能从那上面跳过去" 你没听够吗
"I bet I can jump over that" every time he walked outside?

402
00:14:18,020 --> 00:14:18,760
谢了 卢克
Thanks, Luke.

403
00:14:18,905 --> 00:14:20,440
我们不需要他们 对吗
We don't need them, right?

404
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:21,520
再过几周
In a couple weeks,

405
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:23,180
我们会把他俩都忘干净
we won't remember either one of them.

406
00:14:25,183 --> 00:14:26,279
消防员
A fireman?

407
00:14:27,040 --> 00:14:27,640
修女
A nun?

408
00:14:29,128 --> 00:14:31,634
珍妮丝的口味特别重
Janice was into some really weird stuff.

409
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:37,880
是她吗 那是玛莎·斯图尔特吗
What about her? Is that a Martha Stewart?

410
00:14:37,880 --> 00:14:39,709
我觉得那是戴妃
I-I think that's Princess Di.

411
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:41,680
杰 你得做好心理准备
Jay, you have to prepare yourself.

412
00:14:41,680 --> 00:14:43,152
我们的糖果棒可能找不回来了
We may not find your candy bar.

413
00:14:43,152 --> 00:14:45,360
我们已经问过四个玛莎·斯图尔特
We've stopped four Martha Stewarts,

414
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:47,360
两个赏金猎人老狗和朱迪斯·赖特本人
two Dog the Bounty Hunters, and the real Judith Light.

415
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:48,602
顺带一提 她人真好
How nice was she, by the way?

416
00:14:48,602 --> 00:14:50,383
是啊 落落大方 接着找
Yeah, class act. Keep looking.

417
00:14:51,260 --> 00:14:52,860
是老妈
Hey, that's Mom!

418
00:14:52,954 --> 00:14:53,780
-妈 -曼尼
- Mom! - Manny!

419
00:14:53,780 --> 00:14:56,620
我跟你说过多少次 扮成老头的时候
How many times have I told you not to shout "Mom"

420
00:14:56,620 --> 00:14:58,158
不要大声叫我"妈"
when you're dressed like an old man?

421
00:14:58,158 --> 00:14:59,931
算上这次 就这一次
Including now? Once.

422
00:15:00,460 --> 00:15:02,160
对不起 我不是生你的气
I'm sorry. I'm not mad at you.

423
00:15:02,160 --> 00:15:05,060
我是气米奇和小卡把我丢在这
I'm mad at Mitch and Cam for leaving me here

424
00:15:05,079 --> 00:15:08,320
那个刻薄的童子军又让我觉得自己好老
and the mean Boy Scout that made me feel so old.

425
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:08,660
老
Old?!

426
00:15:09,620 --> 00:15:11,480
亲爱的 你看起来娇艳极了
Sweetie, you look delicious!

427
00:15:11,780 --> 00:15:12,600
-真的吗 -真的
- I do? - Yes.

428
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:14,920
你现在就过来跟我们跳舞
You're dancing with us right now.

429
00:15:14,920 --> 00:15:15,180
好
Okay.

430
00:15:18,780 --> 00:15:21,240
看我在地上发现了什么
Look what I found on the ground.

431
00:15:21,780 --> 00:15:23,180
已经太迟了
We're too late.

432
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:24,500
抱歉 杰
Sorry, Jay.

433
00:15:25,160 --> 00:15:26,560
你想谈谈此刻的感受吗
Do you want to talk about it?

434
00:15:27,020 --> 00:15:28,880
不 我不想看起来像可怜虫一样
No! I don't want to seem like a sad sack.

435
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:33,400
不好意思
Excuse me.

436
00:15:33,400 --> 00:15:35,616
这个糖有什么特别的
What is it about this candy?

437
00:15:35,616 --> 00:15:38,120
有夏天的味道 我说不好
It just tasted like summer or something,

438
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:39,022
我不知道
I don't know.

439
00:15:39,022 --> 00:15:40,960
但一代新糖换旧糖
But out with the old, in with the new.

440
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:42,380
糖果棒停产了
Candy bars come and go.

441
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:45,200
唱片店都不见了
No more record stores.

442
00:15:46,057 --> 00:15:47,873
六岁的儿子长大了
6-year-old sons too grown up

443
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:49,380
万圣节不愿意跟老爸去要糖果
to go trick-or-treating with their dads.

444
00:15:50,808 --> 00:15:52,230
没人再用传呼机了
No more beepers.

445
00:15:52,230 --> 00:15:53,460
乔不想跟你过万圣节
Are you that bummed that

446
00:15:53,460 --> 00:15:54,920
让你这么低落吗
Joe didn't want to spend Halloween with you?

447
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:57,106
不 那只是一个阶段的开始 你懂吗
No! It's just the beginning of the whole thing, ya know?

448
00:15:57,106 --> 00:15:58,611
一旦撕开那个封条
When you-when you break that seal...

449
00:15:58,680 --> 00:16:01,800
我知道乔今晚想和朋友们一起玩
Look, I know Joe wanted to be with his friends tonight,

450
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:04,560
但他肯定还会想跟老爸过万圣节的
but he'll definitely want to spend another Halloween with his dad.

451
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:05,780
你怎么知道
How do you know that?

452
00:16:05,780 --> 00:16:07,020
孩子们总会回头的
Kids have a way of coming back.

453
00:16:08,620 --> 00:16:15,980
哪怕不得不为此编个可笑的借口
Even if they have to... make up a dumb reason to do it.

454
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:18,080
万圣节快乐 孩子
Happy Halloween, kid.

455
00:16:19,860 --> 00:16:21,440
等等 这件事要谨慎处理
Wait, this is a delicate moment.

456
00:16:21,700 --> 00:16:23,920
我们要是没处理好会吓到她的
We could scar her if we don't handle it right.

457
00:16:24,275 --> 00:16:26,152
老天 我知道你这话没错
God, I know that's true.

458
00:16:26,280 --> 00:16:27,720
我的初吻特别可怕
My first kiss was terrible.

459
00:16:27,840 --> 00:16:30,080
我妈撞见我吻一个女孩
My mom walked in on me with this girl.

460
00:16:30,140 --> 00:16:31,960
我至今仍能听到我妈对我爸大喊
I can still hear my mom scream to my dad,

461
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:33,060
"我就说他不是同性恋"
"I told you he wasn't!"

462
00:16:33,060 --> 00:16:34,240
我的更糟
Well, mine was worse.

463
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:35,360
我没跟你比惨
It's not a competition.

464
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:36,466
我爸发现我在谷仓里
My dad found me in a barn

465
00:16:36,466 --> 00:16:37,792
跟橄榄球训练假人舌吻
open-mouth kissing a tackling dummy.

466
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:39,380
你赢了
And you win.

467
00:16:39,380 --> 00:16:41,980
好 我们要温柔但坚定
Okay, so, gentle, but firm.

468
00:16:42,305 --> 00:16:43,342
-知道吗 -知道
- Okay? - Yeah.

469
00:16:48,349 --> 00:16:50,310
亲爱的 你还好吗
Sweetie, is-is everything okay?

470
00:16:50,960 --> 00:16:52,400
我没事 走开
It's nothing. Go away.

471
00:16:52,488 --> 00:16:54,729
宝贝 是不是有男生
Honey, did-did a boy pressure you

472
00:16:54,729 --> 00:16:56,969
逼你做你不想做的事了
to do something you didn't want to do?

473
00:16:56,969 --> 00:16:59,430
恶心 才不是呢
Ew! Gross! No.

474
00:16:59,430 --> 00:17:01,880
那是不是有女生逼你做你不想做....
D-Did a girl pressure you into doing something --

475
00:17:01,880 --> 00:17:03,660
天啊 你能不能去领养另外一个孩子
Oh, my God! Can you adopt a second child

476
00:17:03,660 --> 00:17:05,240
然后别这么目光都聚焦在我身上啊
to take some of this off of me?!

477
00:17:05,240 --> 00:17:08,160
亲爱 亲爱的 我们只是想帮帮你
Honey -- Honey, we -- we just want to help, okay?

478
00:17:08,820 --> 00:17:10,680
我们只是担心或许我们强迫了你
We're -- We're afraid that maybe we pushed you

479
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:12,600
去参加你还没准备好参加的派对
into going to that party before you were ready.

480
00:17:12,700 --> 00:17:15,200
是这样的 我以为有个男生很喜欢我
Look, I thought this boy really liked me,

481
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:17,260
结果他只是利用我来接近我朋友凯利
but he was just using me to get to my friend Kelly.

482
00:17:17,260 --> 00:17:19,160
-凯利吗 她很辣鸡啊 -对啊
- Kelly? Ew, she's gross! - Yeah.

483
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:20,840
她才没有呢 她是我的朋友
No, she isn't. She's my friend.

484
00:17:21,300 --> 00:17:23,400
但她比不上你啊 任何选她而不选你的人...
She's not you. And anyone who would pick her over --

485
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:25,160
你当然会这么说啦 你是我的爸爸
Of course you'd say that. You're my dad.

486
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:28,000
抱歉 你们说什么都安慰不到我的啦
I'm sorry, there's nothing that you could say that would help.

487
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:28,740
懂了吗
Okay?

488
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:31,180
你们不是女生 你们也不是十二岁
You're not a girl, you're not 12.

489
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:33,280
你们怎么可能会懂那种
What would you know about liking a boy

490
00:17:33,280 --> 00:17:34,660
喜欢一个男生而人家不喜欢你的感觉
who doesn't like you back?

491
00:17:35,820 --> 00:17:36,320
亲爱的...
Oh, honey --

492
00:17:36,320 --> 00:17:37,700
我去给大家拿点冰激凌
I'm gonna get us some ice cream.

493
00:17:37,880 --> 00:17:39,480
好啦 你过来 你过来
Okay, come here, come here.

494
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:40,140
好啦
Okay.

495
00:17:40,800 --> 00:17:42,300
老公 你不能因为
Honey, you can't be mad

496
00:17:42,300 --> 00:17:43,640
我看那个电影不被吓到而生气啊
that I wasn't scared by that movie.

497
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:44,740
它就是个婴儿啊
It was a baby.

498
00:17:44,860 --> 00:17:46,440
它有三排牙齿呢
It had three rows of teeth!

499
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:47,560
婴儿乳齿啊
Baby teeth!

500
00:17:47,560 --> 00:17:48,540
这的确不是你的错啦
Look, it's not your fault.

501
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:50,560
只是在你旁边这么比较起来 我就像个孬种
It's just that, next to you, I feel like such a wuss.

502
00:17:50,560 --> 00:17:51,569
只是因为你会因为一部电影
Just because you get a little

503
00:17:51,569 --> 00:17:53,171
而有点发神经不代表你就是...
bit squirrelly in a movie doesn't make you --

504
00:17:53,171 --> 00:17:55,100
等等 我们为什么要过马路
Wait, hang on. Why are we crossing the street?

505
00:17:55,100 --> 00:17:56,120
我们家就在这条街底...
Our house is right down --

506
00:17:56,140 --> 00:17:56,900
等等 你不会是
Wait a minute, you're not

507
00:17:56,900 --> 00:17:58,480
害怕经过那个小老妇人的家吧
afraid of the little old lady's house, are you?

508
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,500
你怎么知道人家小不小
You don't know she's little!

509
00:17:59,778 --> 00:18:01,240
我们对她唯一的了解就是她坐在那里
All we know is she sits up there

510
00:18:01,240 --> 00:18:02,520
在窗前谋划着什么邪恶的计划
plotting evil from her window.

511
00:18:02,520 --> 00:18:03,580
她不在那里了
She's not there.

512
00:18:03,580 --> 00:18:04,701
她不是总是在那里吗
She's always there!

513
00:18:04,701 --> 00:18:05,940
一切今天为止
This stops now.

514
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:07,940
我们现在就去敲人家门
We're gonna go knock on that door,

515
00:18:07,940 --> 00:18:08,980
自我介绍一下
introduce ourselves,

516
00:18:08,980 --> 00:18:11,220
然后让这件神经事就此了结
and put an end to this nuttiness.

517
00:18:21,100 --> 00:18:22,740
开门时机有些诡异啊
Well, that's weird timing.

518
00:18:22,740 --> 00:18:23,760
那个...
The, um...

519
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:25,364
艾丽克斯来递送的东西
The envelope Alex dropped off.

520
00:18:25,364 --> 00:18:26,983
老太太都没有来收耶
The -- The old lady never picked it up.

521
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:28,700
什么声音啊
What was that?

522
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:30,160
天啊 菲尔 她摔倒了可怎么办
Oh, God. Phil, what if she fell?

523
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:31,060
我们进去看看她
We should go check on her.

524
00:18:31,060 --> 00:18:32,080
大概吧
Yeah, I guess so.

525
00:18:32,269 --> 00:18:33,840
我... 你先走我马上来
I am, uh, right behind you.

526
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:35,200
我去找一把手电筒
I'm just gonna go find a flashlight.

527
00:18:35,469 --> 00:18:36,224
菲尔
Phil --

528
00:18:42,659 --> 00:18:43,510
您好
Hello?

529
00:18:45,122 --> 00:18:46,111
曼恩太太
Ms. Mann?

530
00:18:48,140 --> 00:18:50,740
您好
Hello?

531
00:18:57,717 --> 00:18:58,800
艾达·梅
Ida Mae?

532
00:19:04,078 --> 00:19:05,161
艾达·梅
Ida Mae?

533
00:19:11,308 --> 00:19:12,432
曼恩太太
Ms. Mann?

534
00:19:18,640 --> 00:19:21,720
简单扼要 一刀毙命
It was simplicity itself.

535
00:19:21,720 --> 00:19:25,040
一年前 克莱尔第无数次说我
A year ago, Claire accused me for the millionth time

536
00:19:25,040 --> 00:19:27,709
这辈子都吓不到她 所以我想出了一个计划
that I couldn't scare her, so I came up with a plan.

537
00:19:27,709 --> 00:19:29,840
我就把房子买给一堆欧洲人夫妇
I'd just sold a house to a European couple

538
00:19:29,840 --> 00:19:31,641
他们短期内都不会住到这房子里来
that weren't gonna take possession for a while,

539
00:19:31,641 --> 00:19:34,889
然后呢 去年秋天"艾达·梅"就搬来了
so, uh, last fall, "Ida Mae" moved in.

540
00:19:34,889 --> 00:19:35,740
我就跟你说吧
I told you!

541
00:19:35,740 --> 00:19:37,520
她整天都坐在那楼上
She's always up there!

542
00:19:38,040 --> 00:19:41,041
幸好这房子就在克莱尔的慢跑路线中
Fortunately, the house was right on Claire's jogging route,

543
00:19:41,041 --> 00:19:43,420
所以很轻易就能介绍艾达·梅给克莱尔认识
so it was easy to introduce Claire to Ida Mae,

544
00:19:43,420 --> 00:19:46,520
而当我想加大剂量时
and when I wanted to amp it up,

545
00:19:46,939 --> 00:19:49,364
我让艾达·梅跟她打交道了
I had Ida Mae make contact.

546
00:19:53,940 --> 00:19:55,900
时间到了今早
Then, this morning...

547
00:19:56,237 --> 00:19:58,311
我知道斧子的把戏吓不到克莱尔
I knew that ax wouldn't scare Claire.

548
00:19:58,311 --> 00:19:59,580
所以我故意用这招来引诱她
I just did that so she'd accuse me

549
00:19:59,580 --> 00:20:00,980
再次说我这辈子都吓不到她
of not being able to scare her.

550
00:20:00,980 --> 00:20:01,720
关键在于"可信度"
It's all about plausibility.

551
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:03,880
太他妈对了
Damn right, it is.

552
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:05,059
在过去这一年
Over the past year,

553
00:20:05,059 --> 00:20:07,323
艾达·梅加入了邻里协会
Ida Mae joined the neighborhood association,

554
00:20:07,323 --> 00:20:09,040
为她跑掉的狗贴过海报
hung up a poster for her lost dog,

555
00:20:09,040 --> 00:20:10,540
签名申请过慈善送餐活动
signed up for Meals on Wheels.

556
00:20:10,600 --> 00:20:11,740
其实还蛮好吃的呢
They're not bad, by the way.

557
00:20:12,080 --> 00:20:15,140
她还打了很多毛线呢
Also, she got a lot of knitting done.

558
00:20:17,337 --> 00:20:18,860
抱歉啊 克莱尔
Oh, I'm sorry, Claire.

559
00:20:18,860 --> 00:20:20,180
我吓着你了吗
Did I scare you?

560
00:20:21,220 --> 00:20:22,619
-这是你干的好事吗 -是啊
- You did this? - Yep.

561
00:20:22,619 --> 00:20:23,510
你计划这件事多久了
How long have you planned this --

562
00:20:23,510 --> 00:20:25,283
11个月2周又3天之前
11 months, two weeks, and three days ago,

563
00:20:25,283 --> 00:20:26,701
我让艾达·梅·曼恩降临到这世界上
I gave birth to Ida Mae Mann.

564
00:20:26,701 --> 00:20:28,726
因为我就是最强的人[与名字音似]
Because I da main man.

565
00:20:28,726 --> 00:20:30,600
菲尔 不许现在玩谐音梗
Oh, don't you dare do word play, Phil.

566
00:20:30,600 --> 00:20:31,040
抱歉
Sorry.

567
00:20:31,100 --> 00:20:33,296
因为我真是开心死啦
I was having so much fun!

568
00:20:33,296 --> 00:20:35,220
-什么 -我之前总是在想
- What? - I was wondering what we were gonna do

569
00:20:35,220 --> 00:20:36,680
未来这30年 当我们的孩子们
for the next 30 years of our lives

570
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:37,760
都离我们而去时 我们人生有何盼头
without the kids in the house.

571
00:20:37,760 --> 00:20:39,000
但现在我知道了
And now I know --

572
00:20:39,130 --> 00:20:42,060
你也开始扭曲了 我喜欢死了
you're getting twisted, and I like it.

573
00:20:42,060 --> 00:20:42,920
游戏开始
Game on.

574
00:20:44,500 --> 00:20:46,205
"游戏开始" 你这"游戏开始"是什么意思
"Game on"? What do you mean "Game on"?

575
00:20:46,205 --> 00:20:48,540
游戏 游戏已经结束了啊
It's -- It's game over.

576
00:20:48,680 --> 00:20:49,200
没这回事
Nope.

577
00:20:49,200 --> 00:20:50,980
万事小心啊 兄弟
Watch your back, buddy.

578
00:20:51,208 --> 00:20:53,256
这游戏一定会非常非常有趣
This is gonna be so much fun.

579
00:20:54,280 --> 00:20:56,336
我们不能就去旅行吗
Can't we just travel?

580
00:20:56,336 --> 00:20:57,581
你妈去哪了
Where'd your mom go?

581
00:20:58,018 --> 00:21:00,656
优胜者诞生啦
We have a winner!

582
00:21:03,145 --> 00:21:05,702
我今天真的很需要这份鼓励
I really needed this today.

583
00:21:11,140 --> 00:21:12,460
抱歉借过
Excuse me.

584
00:21:12,460 --> 00:21:14,420
那是我老婆
Hey, that's my wife!

585
00:21:14,625 --> 00:21:17,600
想得美啊 宝贝儿 癞蛤蟆也想吃天鹅肉
Sure! Sweet heart. Like you could get that.

586
00:21:17,600 --> 00:21:19,280
不 不是的 他真是我老公
No, no, no. That is my husband.

587
00:21:20,300 --> 00:21:20,910
她知道这是...
Does she know that...

588
00:21:20,910 --> 00:21:22,990
不知道 我们也得一直守住这秘密
No, and we are never gonna tell her.
